+## 3. The oracle campaign (the user directive: read them all, use them all)
+
+Read + used: `docs/GODBOLT_ORACLE.md`, `tools/oracle/godbolt_oracle.py`(+selftest),
+`scripts/godbolt.py`, `godbolt_cache.py`, `codegen_oracle.py` (--rank),
